SUMMARY:Irreducibility of random reciprocal polynomials
DESCRIPTION:Let $P = a_m T^m + \\sum_{j=0}^{m} a_j (T^{m-j} + T^{m+j})$ be 
 a monic reciprocal polynomial of even degree n\, with the $a_j$ drawn inde
 pendently and uniformly at random from $\\{1\, 2\, \\ldots\, H\\}$ for som
 e fixed integer $H \\geq 35$. In joint work with Dimitris Koukoulopoulos\,
  building on prior work of Bary-Soroker—Koukoulopoulos—Kozma\, we show
  that $P$ is irreducible over the rationals\, and has…\nhttps://indico.m
 ath.cnrs.fr/event/17013/
