SUMMARY:Palindromes and Kloostermania
DESCRIPTION:Recently\, there has been a surge in new results on the digital
  properties of numbers. In this talk\, we discuss some recent results on p
 alindromes\, numbers which are the same backwards and forwards (e.g. 12321
